Each file carries a header naming its upstream origin and the exact diff
applied. Dependencies resolved at build time by SwiftPM or pip are NOT
vendored and are not listed here; their licenses travel with them.

1. mlx-swift-lm  (https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-swift-lm)

   Vendored files, both copied from tag 3.31.3:

     Sources/SteeringKit/Models/SteeredQwen3.swift
         from Libraries/MLXLLM/Models/Qwen3.swift
         (upstream author credited in the file header: John Mai; a port of
         mlx-lm's qwen3.py)

     Sources/SteeringKit/Models/SteeredGemma3Text.swift
         from Libraries/MLXLLM/Models/Gemma3Text.swift
         (upstream author credited in the file header: Anthony DePasquale; a
         port of mlx-lm's gemma3_text.py)

   Both files are modified: types are renamed to avoid symbol collision with
   the upstream module, the transformer-block loop calls a residual-stream
   intervention delegate on every forward pass, and the models conform to
   SteerLab's hook and logit-lens protocols. Every modification is enumerated
   at the top of each file so the vendored copies can be re-derived from a
   later upstream release.

